    %h3= "Guadalupe Rock - July 18th, 2026"
    = link_to "View photos", "https://photos.google.com/share/AF1QipN7xNJvYnckJwp5IAel_lSBjuqPPfZ6G9KKynRIIS6E08w7kwYR1Rs2w-tY_7tzXg?key=Q25tdXlBUjZwajJ0TnVzM3pfTHh3Z1NHenAtSmln", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener"
    %details.club-report-details
      %summary Read trip report
      .club-report-copy
        %p= "It was a beautiful day and most of us got to the crag around 11am! There were 4 others climbing, and they were great help figuring out what top rope anchors would be best for the routes we wanted to attempt. Love the climbing community for always being helpful! We did note that next times we should carry an adjustable wrench to tighten bolts that some troublesome people must keep loosening. Definitely check the bolts before setting up anchors!"
        %p= "We set up 2 ropes, and swapped both once. Most did 2 routes, varying range, 5.6 to 5.10+. The temperature was perfect, inching closer to getting hotter just as everyone was about tired."
        %p= "Around 2pm, we started to jump into the creek in our swimsuits, water was clear, refreshing, quite cold (maybe in the 60s), but perfect to end the outing. I be back to attempt the few remaining routes that I have yet to try!"
        %p= "- Mohit"
  %article.club-report
    %h3= "BBQ Social- July 18th, 2026"
    = link_to "View photos", "https://photos.app.goo.gl/ihyWexcp1AQM2uEA7", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener"
    %details.club-report-details
      %summary Read trip report
      .club-report-copy
        %p= "Scott Saifer hosted a summber BBQ Social event at the lake by his house. We had about 25 people show up. Everyone brought lots of great food. Breads, fruits, salads, desserts and more!"
        %p= "It was revealed that years ago Cragmont had an official club chef and Barbecue Grill. We were wondering where this grill is now and how can we find this historic relic."
        %p= "In addition John Hart and Marc Phagan gave away old climbning items such as guide books, training books, rigid stemmed cams, a rick drill and many more items."
        %p= "Hoping to get more non-climbing events like this soon. If anyone wants to host and event at a park or their home say the word and we'll make it happen."
  %article.club-report
    %h3= "Vent Five July 11th, 2026"
    = link_to "View photos", "https://photos.app.goo.gl/NUd9sgxJQCsasCNk9", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener"
    %details.club-report-details
      %summary Read trip report
      .club-report-copy
        %p= "This was the day of my wife and I's wedding anniversary, and we were so hyped for the adventure. Vent 5 is an area that was recommended by so many, the excitement was real. When we arrived, there were exactly two spots remaining in the lot, one for my car and one for Mik's. We gathered the equipment and started the approach."
        %p= "Approach was maybe 20 minutes, but absolutely gorgeous! Everywhere I looked, I wanted to take a picture- some I did! We walked past a few crags, and by the time we were at Juice Shop, I wanted to climb already. A group of us split off, as others continued to Vent 5. The group climbed 2 routes, attemped one, and made way to regroup at Vent 5."
        %p= "Vent 5 was breathtaking, and the tidepools were filled with wildlife. Andria took a nap, others did a few routes, crabs climbed into Mik's bag, and I comtemplated stealing a crab or two because they were very cute! Before I knew it it was later and time to go."
        %p= "Some others stayed for some other awesome routes, I am glad I didn't because it was very tiring to climb up with all the gear!"
        %p= "As someone new to the bay area, I am glad I got to see Vent 5 already within a few months of living here. Even as a hike I thought it was one of my favorites! Another successful day trip with Cragmont Climbing, I am enjoying scheduling these events and plan to confinue to do so! Hope to see everyone again!"
        %p= "- Mohit"
